<title>JAPAN: Japan July silver imports up 30.4 pct year/year.</title>
<headline>Japan July silver imports up 30.4 pct year/year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's silver imports in July</p>
<p>were up 30.4 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance</p>
<p>Ministry data released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     July 96	June 96	 July 95</p>
<p> Total	    106.859	 98.73	    81.97</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Mexico	     36.03	 54.67	    36.01</p>
<p> U.S.		 18.66	 17.61	     0.01</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in the first seven months of 1996 were 656.98 tonnes against 892.00 in the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
